--- !u!114 &47099707
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 47099706}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0838774d98032454bb7e5f4ce8ae16ac, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: ???
    portrait: {fileID: -1831384829, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: "Ooo Mr. Angel! Hi\u2026"
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: "what do you want \u2026 ooo \u2026 interesting.."
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: What a... bright character...
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: Who are you?
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: -2079718300, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: I am Lucerna! Nice to meetcha!
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: Oh...! what a .. 'bubbly' character you are...
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: -2079718300, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: mmmhm!
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: "Well, you are quite the anomaly\u2026 You know, this \u2018world\u2019
      has been dark since the day Apocalypse descended\u2026"
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: A huge wave of vile, grimy sludge washed over every corner of the world,
      suppressing the color, the feeling, the life of our world.
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: "Lucky was it that some of us were able to concentrate our consciousness
      into these statues across the world\u2026"
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: 955586193, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: zzzzz...
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: HEY! Are you even listening?!?
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: 1953571637, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: "huh? Oh yeah I heard... I heard, something about sludge\u2026. \r\n*yawn*\r\n"
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: "Ugh whatever. I\u2019m always here for the boring stuff\u2026"
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: "Well there are other statues which will teach you more \u2018entertaining\u2019
      things\u2026hurry up and get to them\u2026"
  - speakerName: Angel Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1577949713, guid: f134cfe77d5022b4d9793b81382c69d9, type: 3}
    text: Oh yeah...try not to die on your journey!
  interactPrompt: {fileID: 598885618}
  bobSpeed: 1.5
  bobAmount: 0.05
  playerTag: Player
